      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "入口与编排",
      "items": [
        "CLI / Python API / HTTP 三入口;/ocr/{preset} 路由即策略",
        "preset 匹配引擎名 → engine;匹配预设名 → strategy_name",
        "RuntimeConfig 线程安全;GET /config 只回 has_api_key"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "引擎层(惰性注册)",
      "items": [
        "import jykj_ocr 不加载 PIL/rapidocr/openai",
        "两个类型 rapidocr + multimodal;siliconflow 等只是别名,平台由 base_url + model 决定",
        "base_url 解析不出即 EngineNotAvailable——不静默回退到某个平台"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "策略预设与重试",
      "items": [
        "seq* / cascade*:local / vl / seq(-any / -low_conf / -line_overlap)",
        "bestof*:smart / fastest / confidence / longest / fluency + bestof:<mode>",
        "apply_strategy_preset 返回 deepcopy,不改 base config"
      ]
    }
